        <StdOut>Given a heat-equation source case from "heat_equation/sample/gaussian.json"
-&gt; done: HeatEquationAmplitudeSteps.GivenAHeatEquationSourceCase("heat_equation/sam...") (0.0s)
And a heat-equation transformation "ScaleAmplitude" with parameter "factor" set to "2"
-&gt; done: HeatEquationAmplitudeSteps.GivenTheHeatEquationTransformation("ScaleAmplitude", "factor", "2") (0.0s)
When I run source and the generated follow-up through the heat-equation solver
