    <UnitTestResult executionId="572d14ea-6bc9-4d4b-b681-36277951bf76" testId="6bc3f0b4-d702-c3f9-cbd8-ccfe313c3af6" testName="Follow-up input generated by ScalarMultiply produces a greater output" computerName="vm" duration="00:00:00.2050288" startTime="2026-05-16T09:11:57.2921726+00:00" endTime="2026-05-16T09:11:57.2921727+00:00" testType="13cdc9d9-ddb5-4fa4-a97d-d965ccfc6d4b" outcome="Passed" testListId="8c84fa94-04c1-424b-9868-57a2d4851a1d" relativeResultsDirectory="572d14ea-6bc9-4d4b-b681-36277951bf76">
      <Output>
        <StdOut>Given a source MT case with input value "5"
-&gt; done: SystemLevelGeneratedFollowupSteps.GivenASourceMtCaseWithInputValue("5") (0.0s)
And the MR transformation "ScalarMultiply" with parameter "multiplier" set to "3"
-&gt; done: SystemLevelGeneratedFollowupSteps.GivenTheMrTransformationWithParameter("ScalarMultiply", "multiplier", "3") (0.0s)
When I run source and the generated follow-up with program profile "example-cli"
-&gt; done: SystemLevelGeneratedFollowupSteps.WhenIRunSourceAndTheGeneratedFollowUp("example-cli") (0.2s)
