    <UnitTestResult executionId="4755c4e7-33e2-4c04-8424-e54c5eb8e657" testId="eb4e6021-c5cc-31bb-98e2-3750c7201755" testName="Follow-up k_eff is less than source k_eff after scaling fuel sigma_a" computerName="vm" duration="00:00:01.7826963" startTime="2026-05-16T09:11:56.6249111+00:00" endTime="2026-05-16T09:11:56.6249113+00:00" testType="13cdc9d9-ddb5-4fa4-a97d-d965ccfc6d4b" outcome="Passed" testListId="8c84fa94-04c1-424b-9868-57a2d4851a1d" relativeResultsDirectory="4755c4e7-33e2-4c04-8424-e54c5eb8e657">
      <Output>
        <StdOut>Given an OpenMOC pin-cell sigma_a source case from "openmoc/sample/pincell.json"
-&gt; done: OpenMocPinCellSigmaASteps.GivenAnOpenMocSigmaASourceCase("openmoc/sample/pi...") (0.5s)
And the OpenMOC sigma_a transformation "ScaleFuelSigmaA" with parameter "factor" set to "1.5"
-&gt; done: OpenMocPinCellSigmaASteps.GivenTheSigmaATransformation("ScaleFuelSigmaA", "factor", "1.5") (0.0s)
When I run source and the generated follow-up through OpenMOC for sigma_a
-&gt; done: OpenMocPinCellSigmaASteps.WhenIRunThroughOpenMocSigmaA() (1.3s)
Then the OpenMOC parsed value "k_eff" of the generated follow-up should be less than the source
-&gt; done: OpenMocPinCellSigmaASteps.ThenTheOpenMocParsedValueShouldBeLess("k_eff") (0.0s)
And the OpenMOC follow-up k_eff should be at most 0.85 times the source k_eff
-&gt; done: OpenMocPinCellSigmaASteps.ThenFollowUpKeffRatioCeiling(0.85) (0.0s)</StdOut>
      </Output>
    </UnitTestResult>
    <UnitTestResult executionId="c70f325d-7a65-4edb-afa0-ba3f2a6a2c3c" testId="3b217d11-e9c9-9ed7-7b1f-97076d4e1e97" testName="ScaleFuelSigmaA decreases k_eff regardless of solver(solver: &quot;openmoc&quot;, sut: &quot;openmoc&quot;, __pickleIndex: &quot;2&quot;, exampleTags: [])" computerName="vm" duration="00:00:01.9651805" startTime="2026-05-16T09:11:56.6593199+00:00" endTime="2026-05-16T09:11:56.6593200+00:00" testType="13cdc9d9-ddb5-4fa4-a97d-d965ccfc6d4b" outcome="Passed" testListId="8c84fa94-04c1-424b-9868-57a2d4851a1d" relativeResultsDirectory="c70f325d-7a65-4edb-afa0-ba3f2a6a2c3c">
      <Output>
        <StdOut>Given a pin-cell neutron-transport source case from "openmoc/sample/pincell.json" for solver "openmoc"
-&gt; done: CrossProgramSteps.GivenPinCellSourceCaseForSolver("openmoc/sample/pi...", "openmoc") (0.6s)
And an MR transformation "ScaleFuelSigmaA" with factor "1.5"
-&gt; done: CrossProgramSteps.GivenMrTransformation("ScaleFuelSigmaA", "1.5") (0.0s)
When I run source and the generated follow-up through the "openmoc" solver
-&gt; done: CrossProgramSteps.WhenIRunThroughSolver("openmoc") (1.3s)
Then the follow-up k_eff should be strictly less than the source k_eff
-&gt; done: CrossProgramSteps.ThenFollowUpKEffLess() (0.0s)</StdOut>
      </Output>
    </UnitTestResult>
